@seunghunee I think we can do a top-level (or describe-level) setTimeout:

```js
test.beforeAll(async () => {
  // Long beforeAll hook...
});

// Increase timeout for all tests in this file.
test.setTimeout(120000);

test('my test', async ({ page }) => {
});
```

Does that work for you?

